 * Cidmap — unified stylesheet.
 *
 * The single stylesheet for index.html. Sections keep the original cascade
 * order of the former per-feature files. The legacy Tableaux styles are
 * scoped to the Tableaux surfaces (#tableauxViewContainer, Anticipé and
 * archive clones) so they never change html/body, the shell or other views.
 * The last section is the authoritative Tableaux scroll contract.
 */


